          <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
Could not find wargear Molten Body
	 Checked under Molten Body
Could not find wargear The Wailing Doom
	 Checked under The Wailing Doom</comment>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Molten Body" hidden="false" id="320d-d02f-4073-a8c4">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Molten Body" hidden="false" id="b1ca-8eac-5c22-035b" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="90">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The Molten Body of an Avatar of Khaine flows like wax to seal even the most grievous wounds. A Molten Body provides a 3+ Invulnerable Save. Weapons of the Flame, Melta, and Volkite types can never cause Wounds to a model with a Molten Body, and any allocated to a model with a Molten Body are immediately discarded.
In addition, when a model with a Molten Body and a Wounds Characteristic loses its last Wound, but before it is removed as a casualty, all models both friendly and enemy within D6+6" suffer an automatic Hit at Str 8, AP -.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f3f2-b75e-59a0-5660"/>
