      <rules>
        <rule name="A Bloody-Handed God" id="e36f-2d8e-46c3-b19b" page="90" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>Unlike other models with the Daemon Primarch Unit Type, an Avatar of Khaine may never be selected to be your Warlord, and may not select a Warlord Trait – you must select another eligible model from your army instead. In addition, the Avatar of Khaine may never join or be joined by any other model or unit, and may not be given any manner of Retinue during army selection.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Khaine Awakened" id="1aa4-aaf7-4db6-8070" page="90" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>All friendly units within 12" of the Avatar of Khaine which can draw line of sight to it and have the Asuryani Unit Sub-type gain the Stubborn and Rage (2) Special Rules.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
