                <characteristic typeId="ddd7-6f5c-a939-b69e" name="Unit Type">Phoenix Lord (Asuryani, Unique)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Hand of Asuryan" hidden="false" id="c0a5-d6b6-dd45-8f74" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="91">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Asurmen automatically has the Hand of Asuryan Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
All other models with any variant of the Aspect Shrine (X) Special Rule in the same army as Asurmen gain the Stubborn Special Rule. If a model has the Aspect Shrine (Dire Avenger) Special Rule in the same army as Asurmen, they may also use this model’s Leadership Characteristic instead of their own.
In addition, an army that includes a Warlord with this Trait may make an additional Reaction in any one Phase per turn, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty (the Phase in which the additional Reaction is made does not need to be declared in advance).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <constraints>
