            </profile>
            <profile name="The Lancer’s Charge" hidden="false" id="00ed-1f52-fdfa-a9ee" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="93">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Drastanta automatically has The Lancer’s Charge as their Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
Once per game in the Controlling Player’s Charge phase, the Controlling Player may declare a Lance Charge. All models with the Aspect Shrine (Shining Spear) Special Rule in the same army as Drastanta roll an additional dice, discarding the lowest rolled dice, for determining the results of the Charge Distance Roll until the end of the Controlling Player’s current Charge phase. All models with the Aspect Shrine (Shining Spear) Special Rule in the same army as Drastanta also count their Hammer of Wrath (X) Special Rule as being one higher than normal on a turn in which a Lance Charge is declared - Hammer of Wrath (2) becoming (3), and so on.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f47e-b0ed-4890-93db"/>
