              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Rhana Dandra" hidden="false" id="ed73-19e6-edc1-2016" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="94">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Fuegan automatically has the Rhana Dandra Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
All models with the Aspect Shrine (Fire Dragon) Special Rule in the same army as Fuegan gain the Dragon of Myth and Feel No Pain (5+) Special Rules.
In addition, an army that includes a Warlord with this Trait may make an additional Reaction in the Shooting phase as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
