      <rules>
        <rule name="Dragon of Myth" id="4e35-4b21-4880-a32d" page="94" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>At the start of any Fight Sub-phase, each model with this Special Rule within base to base contact with an enemy model makes D3 additional attacks at Initiative step 10. These attacks are resolved at Strength 4 with an AP of -, and are counted as "Flame" attacks for those rules that affect such attacks.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Unquenchable Resolve" id="044a-1f9a-4271-a227" page="94" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>At the end of any phase in which a model with this Special Rule suffers one or more unsaved Wounds, their Strength and Attack Characteristics are increased by +1 for each unsaved Wound suffered. These Characteristic bonuses are permanent and last for the rest of the game (Note that Damage Mitigation Rolls do not prevent this Special Rule from taking effect).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
