            <profile name="Reaper of Souls" hidden="false" id="89f1-5cd2-5159-9a8c" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="95">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Irillyth automatically has the Reaper of Souls Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
All models with the Aspect Shrine (Shadow Spectre) Special Rule in the same army as Irillyth gain the Night Vision and Ignores Cover Special Rules.
