      <rules>
        <rule name="Dawn of Twilight" id="0075-f7bd-4c49-a5d5" page="95" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>During any mission where the Night Fighting Rules are in effect, a player whose army includes Irillyth may choose to force Night Fighting to be used, without the need for a dice roll. In addition, the Controlling Player may re-roll any dice rolled during the game to determine whether Night Fighting Rules stay in effect during a Game Turn.
Ghoststrike: On any turn in which Irillyth charges a unit that has suffered at least one successful Hit from a weapon with the Ghostlight type, the Spear of Starlight’s Wanelight Glaive profile is changed to Strength +3, and gains the Armourbane (Melee) and Murderous Strike (5+) Special Rules until the end of that player turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
