            <profile name="The Reaper’s Gaze" hidden="false" id="2113-fffe-56a0-4fa6" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="97">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Maugan Ra automatically has The Reaper’s Gaze as his Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
After Deployment, but before the first turn begins, the Controlling Player may nominate a single unit from your Opponent’s army. All models with the Aspect Shrine (Dark Reaper) Special Rule gain the Precision Shots (5+) and Precision Strikes (5+) Special Rules whilst making any attack targeting the nominated unit.
In addition, an army that includes a Warlord with this Trait may make an additional Reaction in the Shooting phase as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
