                <profile name="The Maugetar" hidden="false" id="948f-0701-c366-2846" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d" page="97">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Bio-Cataclysm: If a model with a Toughness Characteristic is slain as a result of a weapon with this Special Rule, centre a Large Blast (5") marker over the slain model. All models under the marker suffer an immediate, automatic hit at Strength 5, AP 5 with the Ignores Cover Special Rule. Note that models slain in this manner do not generate additional Bio-Cataclysm markers.
Whirlwind of Death: Maugan Ra may fire The Maugetar twice during the Controlling Player’s Shooting Phase. These Shooting Attacks may be made at different targets.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
