              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If chosen as the army’s Warlord, Jain Zar automatically has the Storm of Silence Warlord Trait and may not select any other Warlord Trait.
All models with the Aspect Shrine (Howling Banshee) Special Rule in an Army which includes Jain Zar gain Furious Charge (1) and the Crusader Special Rules.
