                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">During the Assault phase, the Reactive player may not make Reactions targeting a unit that contains at least one model equipped with Terror’s Lament. Furthermore, whilst an enemy is in base contact with a model equipped with Terror’s Lament, its Attacks and Initiative Characteristics are reduced by 1, to a minimum of 1. This wargear’s effect does not activate if the unit equipped with it makes a Disordered Charge.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
