      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Disarming Strike" id="a1ac-5979-43f4-8edd" page="98" publicationId="a368-64f0-10c7-c49d">
          <description>Before rolling to Hit whilst in a challenge, a model with this Special Rule can choose to nominate one of the Opponent’s model’s melee weapons. Both Jain Zar and the opposing model must then roll a D6 and add their Weapon Skill; the model with the highest result being the Winner. If the opposing model is the Winner, Jain Zar reduces her Attacks Characteristics by -3 for the duration of that Assault phase. If Jain Zar is the Winner, Jain Zar reduces her Attacks Characteristics by -1 for the duration of that Assault phase, whilst the Opposing model counts as no longer being equipped with the nominated melee weapon for the duration of that Assault phase. Any Characteristic Modifiers applied by this Special Rules ignore the normal restrictions found in the Phoenix Lord Unit Type.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <comment>!BSC Errors from 20240406-1603
Could not find rule: Disarming Strike</comment>
    </selectionEntry>
